    "body": "<header>\n<h1 data-aid=\"128475779\" id=\"title1\"><strong>Jesus Christ, Good Shepherd</strong></h1>\n</header>\n<div class=\"body-block\">\n<nav class=\"index\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128475780\" id=\"p1\">the <span class=\"key-word\">shepherd</span>, the stone of Israel, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/gen/49?lang=eng&amp;id=p24#p24\">Gen. 49:24</a> (<a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/dc-testament/dc/50?lang=eng&amp;id=p44#p44\">D&amp;C 50:44</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128475781\" id=\"p2\">Lord is my <span class=\"key-word\">shepherd</span>, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/ps/23?lang=eng&amp;id=p1#p1\">Ps. 23:1</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128475782\" id=\"p3\">O <span class=\"key-word\">Shepherd</span> of Israel, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/ps/80?lang=eng&amp;id=p1#p1\">Ps. 80:1</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128475783\" id=\"p4\">people of his pasture, and the <span class=\"key-word\">sheep</span> of his hand, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/ps/95?lang=eng&amp;id=p7#p7\">Ps. 95:7</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128475784\" id=\"p5\">shall feed his flock like a <span class=\"key-word\">shepherd</span>, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/isa/40?lang=eng&amp;id=p11#p11\">Isa. 40:11</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128475785\" id=\"p6\">so will I seek out my <span class=\"key-word\">sheep</span>, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/ezek/34?lang=eng&amp;id=p12#p12\">Ezek. 34:12</a>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n<nav class=\"index\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128475786\" id=\"p7\">I am the good <span class=\"key-word\">shepherd</span>, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/john/10?lang=eng&amp;id=p14#p14\">John 10:14</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128475787\" id=\"p8\">other <span class=\"key-word\">sheep</span> I have, which are not of this fold, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/john/10?lang=eng&amp;id=p16#p16\">John 10:16</a> (<a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/3-ne/15?lang=eng&amp;id=p21#p21\">3 Ne. 15:21</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/dc-testament/dc/10?lang=eng&amp;id=p59#p59\">D&amp;C 10:59</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128475788\" id=\"p9\">Lord Jesus, that great <span class=\"key-word\">shepherd</span> of the sheep, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/heb/13?lang=eng&amp;id=p20#p20\">Heb. 13:20</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128475789\" id=\"p10\">returned unto the <span class=\"key-word\">Shepherd</span> and Bishop of your souls, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/1-pet/2?lang=eng&amp;id=p25#p25\">1 Pet. 2:25</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128475790\" id=\"p11\">chief <span class=\"key-word\">Shepherd</span> shall appear, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/1-pet/5?lang=eng&amp;id=p4#p4\">1 Pet. 5:4</a>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n<nav class=\"index\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128475791\" id=\"p12\">one God and one <span class=\"key-word\">Shepherd</span> over all, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/1-ne/13?lang=eng&amp;id=p41#p41\">1 Ne. 13:41</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128475792\" id=\"p13\">numbereth his <span class=\"key-word\">sheep</span>, and they know him, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/1-ne/22?lang=eng&amp;id=p25#p25\">1 Ne. 22:25</a> (<a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/3-ne/18?lang=eng&amp;id=p31#p31\">3 Ne. 18:31</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128475793\" id=\"p14\">he that will hear my voice shall be my <span class=\"key-word\">sheep</span>, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/mosiah/26?lang=eng&amp;id=p21#p21\">Mosiah 26:21</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128475794\" id=\"p15\">good <span class=\"key-word\">shepherd</span> doth call you … in his own name … Christ, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/alma/5?lang=eng&amp;id=p38#p38\">Alma 5:38</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128475796\" id=\"p16\">follow the voice of the good <span class=\"key-word\">shepherd</span>, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/alma/5?lang=eng&amp;id=p57#p57\">Alma 5:57</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128475798\" id=\"p17\">not hearken unto the voice of the good <span class=\"key-word\">shepherd</span>, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/hel/7?lang=eng&amp;id=p18#p18\">Hel. 7:18</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128475801\" id=\"p18\">their Redeemer, and their great and true <span class=\"key-word\">shepherd</span>, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/hel/15?lang=eng&amp;id=p13#p13\">Hel. 15:13</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128475804\" id=\"p19\">one fold, and one <span class=\"key-word\">shepherd</span>, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/3-ne/15?lang=eng&amp;id=p21#p21\">3 Ne. 15:21</a> (<a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/3-ne/16?lang=eng&amp;id=p3#p3\">16:3</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128475806\" id=\"p20\">had Christ for their <span class=\"key-word\">shepherd</span>, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/morm/5?lang=eng&amp;id=p17#p17\">Morm. 5:17</a>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n</div>",
